        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS PLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE FIRST VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\n*** IMMACULATE 2 BEDROOM / 2 BATHROOM APARTMENT *** REGISTER YOUR INTEREST TODAY ***\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this immaculate two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment to the rental market, ideally located in the highly sought-after Virginia Hall development, Tallaght, Dublin 24.\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, this bright and spacious apartment offers well-proportioned living accommodation finished to a high standard. The accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a spacious open-plan living and dining area, a modern fully fitted kitchen with ample storage and integrated appliances, two generous double bedrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite, and a stylish main bathroom.\nThe property has been exceptionally well maintained and is presented in turnkey condition, offering comfortable and contemporary living in a prime residential location. Bright interiors, quality finishes, and thoughtfully designed living spaces make this an ideal home for a wide range of tenants. The property also benefits from one designated parking space.\nVirginia Hall is ideally situated in the heart of Tallaght, offering a wealth of local amenities including The Square Shopping Centre, cafés, restaurants, supermarkets, parks, and leisure facilities. Excellent public transport links are available nearby, including the LUAS Red Line, while the N7, M50, and Dublin City Centre are all easily accessible, making this an ideal location for commuters.\n\nAdditional Features:\nImmaculate 2 Bed / 2 Bath apartment\nBright and spacious living accommodation\nTwo generous double bedrooms\nMaster bedroom with ensuite\nModern fully fitted kitchen\nOne designated parking space\nPrime Tallaght location\nExcellent access to the LUAS, M50, N7, and Dublin City Centre\nRegister your interest today\nRAY COOKE 